F Flatten                  | CurveSolver.h | 82    | api,nonthrowing           | 🚩 | Appends the flattened polyline of one segment, excluding its origin and including its terminus. an outline at whatever reduction level a tile was promoted to, so a fixed tolerance is either wasteful at coarse levels or visibly polygonal at fine ones — `52` §4. more than the tolerance. Uniform subdivision at a fixed count is either wrong on a tight curve or wasteful on a slack one, and a path carries both.
